.TH XVIC20 1 "2026-08-05" "xemu" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
xvic20 \- Commodore VIC-20 emulator (Xemu / X-Emulators)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xvic20
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xvic20
emulates the Commodore VIC-20. It is one of the emulators in LGB's Xemu
("X-Emulators") suite, a collection of emulators for mostly Commodore and
Hungarian 8-bit machines sharing a common SDL2-based core.

.PP
No ROM images are shipped with this package. Supply them yourself with
.BR \-rom ,
or place them where the emulator's configuration expects.
.SH OPTIONS
Options vary per emulator and per build. Run
.B xvic20 \-h
for the authoritative list. Options commonly useful for scripted or
non-interactive use include:
.TP
.B \-skipconfigfile
Skip loading the default config file. Must be the \fIfirst\fR option.
.TP
.B \-headless
Run without a window (intended for testing).
.TP
.B \-sleepless
Run at maximum emulation speed rather than real time.
.TP
.B \-rom \fIFILE\fR
Override the system ROM image to load.
.TP
.B \-dumpmem \fIFILE\fR
Write memory contents to \fIFILE\fR on exit.
.TP
.B \-fullscreen
Start in fullscreen mode.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/xemu\-lgb/
Per-emulator configuration and state.
